<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12095] .NET: Remove empty tracing-related interfaces from public API</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12095</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Remove IMetricExporterSpi and ITracingSpi. They bring zero value and can confuse users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;They were added because of failing API Parity tests. We should disable those tests to avoid confusing other team members, and run them manually when needed to check for new APIs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
